    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Access and pricing</h2>
    <p>Now: trusted cyber defenders through the Fairwind Program, plus Google’s own internal use. Not the public. No Gemini API model page was up on 1 October 2026. Broader access, when it comes, starts with paid API customers and Google AI Ultra subscribers. No date.</p>
